flowchart LR
    R[Search result] --> D{Complete person and institution?}
    D -->|No| X[Reject with typed category]
    D -->|Yes| P[Prospective Supervisor]
    P --> E[Extract known page]
    E --> I[Ground exact identity EvidenceClaim]
    I --> O{Official singular person page?}
    O -->|No| S[Require subject-led excerpt]
    O -->|Yes| L[Link exact same-page section to subject identity evidence ID]
    S --> V[Validate typed claim fields]
    L --> V
    V --> Q{Evidence sufficient?}
    Q -->|No; retry remains| A[Locate one alternate official person page]
    A --> E
    Q -->|Yes| F[Verified Supervisor]
    Q -->|No; retry exhausted| Z[Stop with partial verification]
